    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512810/extras/bbb4df148037256dea73422e1eb36aec.avif?t=1697815590\" /></span><br>Immerse yourself in a unique adventure with Kane and Flappy! Run, jump and solve situations taking into account the physical laws of the new pixelated world. Visit spacious and lively places in the classic 2D platform style, the best setting to live a great adventure.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512810/extras/6259aebcd756cf2b1dfe3c4c35964a9c.avif?t=1697815590\" /></span><br>\u2022 Jump around the world at full <strong>speed</strong> and solve puzzles with complete<strong> peace of mind</strong>!<br>\u2022 Master all <strong>physical laws and skills</strong> to complete<i> The Great Book</i>!<br>\u2022 <strong>Interact</strong> with the other inhabitants!<br>\u2022 Face all kinds of <strong>unique situations and challenges</strong>!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512810/extras/1943a3fdec04d0abfb8dd2b720d65949.avif?t=1697815590\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512810/extras/6153762716e17fa9f75adecdd48afdd7.avif?t=1697815590\" /></span><br>Kane has gotten stuck in a video game after turning on an arcade machine that was among her grandmother's old gadgets; a very renowned scientist. Appearing in this <strong>new pixelated world</strong>, Kane meets <i>Flappy</i>, a rabbit passionate about finding the <strong>physical rules</strong> that complete <i>The Great Book </i>, book that keeps all the secrets of his world and could help Kane return home. For this reason, the paths of these two characters cross to make them live a great adventure that will test them.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512810/extras/6142db9537cfb5adad861cfb9c09343e.avif?t=1697815590\" /></span><br><br><strong>MEET THE PROTAGONISTS</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512810/extras/6def462455e116e3b011e68770d226b7.avif?t=1697815590\" /></span>",
